## Mobile Performance

### Image Optimization
```html
<!-- ✅ DO: Use responsive images -->
<picture>
  <source 
    media="(max-width: 768px)"
    srcset="image-mobile.webp">
  <source 
    media="(min-width: 769px)"
    srcset="image-desktop.webp">
  <img 
    src="image-fallback.jpg" 
    alt="Description"
    loading="lazy">
</picture>
```

